{"text":"But what if the law only pities the few? What if the word flesh in your mouth is hushed, hot, and taut like a trigger? What if, digger, bury them deep, throw them in the pit, get moving, they say. They didn't know we were seeds, it's to say didn't know we feed off of the underground that we've been ground into chains, into rust, or rust into rail, or rail into must not fail, long heard tales of words the tongue owns like a birthmark. But this choking, this woping, this lynching, this smoking, the dying while hoping is a non-starter. I didn't come here to be no martyr, the man didn't die for me, he died for himself, he died in himself, the man who wasn't himself as long as he was something less than free. You see, you don't get out of your skin yet.","words":[{"text":"But","start":0.0,"end":0.58},{"text":"what","start":0.58,"end":0.72},{"text":"if","start":0.72,"end":0.86},{"text":"the","start":0.86,"end":1.0},{"text":"law","start":1.0,"end":1.2},{"text":"only","start":1.2,"end":1.52},{"text":"pities","start":1.52,"end":1.9},{"text":"the","start":1.9,"end":2.28},{"text":"few","start":2.28,"end":2.56,"punct":"?"},{"text":"What","start":2.7,"end":2.84},{"text":"if","start":2.84,"end":3.16},{"text":"the","start":3.16,"end":3.4},{"text":"word","start":3.4,"end":3.64},{"text":"flesh","start":3.64,"end":4.06},{"text":"in","start":4.06,"end":4.34},{"text":"your","start":4.34,"end":4.46},{"text":"mouth","start":4.46,"end":4.72},{"text":"is","start":4.72,"end":4.96},{"text":"hushed","start":4.96,"end":5.4,"punct":","},{"text":"hot","start":5.84,"end":5.86,"punct":","},{"text":"and","start":6.04,"end":6.12},{"text":"taut","start":6.12,"end":6.42},{"text":"like","start":6.42,"end":6.66},{"text":"a","start":6.66,"end":6.84},{"text":"trigger","start":6.84,"end":7.1,"punct":"?"},{"text":"What","start":7.3,"end":7.44},{"text":"if","start":7.44,"end":7.9,"punct":","},{"text":"digger","start":7.9,"end":8.46,"punct":","},{"text":"bury","start":8.78,"end":9.0},{"text":"them","